Skype Limited, Octasic, Jean-Marc Valin, Timothy B. Terriberry, CSIRO, Gregory Maxwell, Mark Borgerding, Erik de
Castro Lopo, Mozilla, Amazon - under the three-clause BSD licence in libopus/COPYING, which also names the patent
licences that come with Opus. A program that ships the library built from it has to reproduce that copyright
notice, the conditions and the disclaimer in its documentation or other materials.

tee_opus.h and tee_opus.c are the TEE VP9 project's own. They have no licence file of their own yet.
